<h2>Interview Scheduled: <%= jobTitle %>
</h2>
<p>Hello <%= name %>,</p>

<p>We are pleased to inform you that you have been invited to an interview for the <b>
        <%= jobTitle %>
    </b> position at <b>
        <%= company %>
    </b>. Please find the details below:</p>

<table class="table-data" style="margin: 24px 0;">
    <tr>
        <th width="30%">Date & Time</th>
        <td>
            <%= new Date(date).toLocaleString('en-US', { weekday: 'long' , year: 'numeric' , month: 'long' ,
                day: 'numeric' , hour: '2-digit' , minute: '2-digit' }) %>
        </td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <th>Interview Type</th>
        <td>
            <%= type.charAt(0).toUpperCase() + type.slice(1) %>
        </td>
    </tr>
    <% if (type==='ONLINE' ) { %>
        <tr>
            <th>Meeting Link</th>
            <td><a href="<%= location %>" target="_blank" style="color: #2563eb; text-decoration: none;">
                    <%= location %>
                </a></td>
        </tr>
        <% } else { %>
            <tr>
                <th>Venue</th>
                <td>
                    <%= location %>
                </td>
            </tr>
            <% } %>
</table>

<p>Please ensure you are prepared and punctual. If you have any further questions or require accommodations, please
    reach out to the placement coordinator immediately.</p>

<table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">
    <tr>
        <td align="center">
            <table border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">
                <tr>
                    <td align="center" style="border-radius: 6px;" bgcolor="#2563eb">
                        <a href="<%= loginUrl %>" target="_blank" class="button">View Application Dashboard</a>
                    </td>
                </tr>
            </table>
        </td>
    </tr>
</table>

<p>Best regards,<br>The Placement Cell Team</p>